		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=5099&amp;p=36992#p36992"><![CDATA[
Whenever you change a setting, if you want to make it permanent you must press SK2 + Green.  That saves it to the code plug. If you only press Green then is is only temporary. <br><br>Colin G4EML<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=87">G4EML</a> — Sun May 04, 2025 9:53 pm</p><hr />
