The problem here is that (I may not have made this entirely clear in my original message) the value of "Set" does not "hold" after I power the HT off - even if I change "Set" manually. When I power the HT on after some time, the value of "Set" is back to its default, 2.5 MHz. This sucks. I do not want it to change when I power the HT off. Is there a way?<br><br>PS: VOF A and B are both set to 12.5 MHz.<br><br>Thanks. 73.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=8496">PU5THM</a> — Sun May 04, 2025 9:01 pm</p><hr />
